---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout>
  <div slot="main" class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
    <h1>What I'm Doing Now</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      This is my "now page" - a snapshot of what I'm currently focused on in my life and work.
      Last updated: June 19, 2026
      <!-- new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' }) -->
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-8 mt-8">
      <section>
        <h2>👨‍💻 Work</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Building a visualisation library for a new domain-specific language (DSL) using <a href="https://github.com/xdslproject/xdsl">xDSL</a>, an easy compiler toolkit based on <a href="https://mlir.llvm.org/">MLIR</a>.</li>
          <li>Writing better documentation, system architectures, design diagrams, etc. This has massively improved my use of AI.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>📚 Learning</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Learning how to use AI more effectively as part of my workflow. I finally decided to utilise it in my day-to-day job.</li>
          <li>Learning how to manage people. I'm stepping up to experience what it's like to be a manager.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>📚 Music, Books, and Movies</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>I've recently enjoyed Ibrahim Maalouf's concert in Cambridge, and now I'm playing his album <a href="https://open.spotify.com/album/6DG1fFlFCKOfwijUzTjGeZ?si=13VTIHDxSzq7XpnL_q_eLw">Trumpets Of Michel Ange (T.O.M.A)</a> all day.</li>
          <li>My girlfriend and I are translating <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/en/book/show/26845643-notes-on-suicide">Notes on Suicide</a> by Simon Critchley.</li>
          <li>I'm watching <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vikings_(TV_series)">Vikings</a> on and off.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
      <p>
        Inspired by <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">nownownow.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout> 
